uhUEQ1ZOcszQXgBsgtLa5CNApJMseoxbAyifYvlLLe2LXZ2INlkqGLthhH7DwRFaYCOuiMsFuD2oP6JpZaNnE7YjfriYheQdf-kzbFnMBQIrRUVXSVcAd_U3yxhrE38fqzEgV7NB4Ic6_dyvxKd5JylQb7MLc8u\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh78euRTUOgswqES10o7s0f2zr4WlAw8uhUEQ1ZOcszQXgBsgtLa5CNApJMseoxbAyifYvlLLe2LXZ2INlkqGLthhH7DwRFaYCOuiMsFuD2oP6JpZaNnE7YjfriYheQdf-kzbFnMBQIrRUVXSVcAd_U3yxhrE38fqzEgV7NB4Ic6_dyvxKd5JylQb7MLc8u\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhmC09enIkqfv3288s4b9ld-A6Tjiw7HHkY0qdiz63uM6LsNNH9V4nfnUULsAgBUQSm--nZRASxEc3GbF8AtvyzulpAto0ei2_WZ-DwhXlFEnZlSUEaeA45Eh56M2Py15a7tcZbLGgNnP7lSr1sKDizx3RBNbjOaS87ooXy-JEM8_FjxtWlPQL603S3YJrB\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhmC09enIkqfv3288s4b9ld-A6Tjiw7HHkY0qdiz63uM6LsNNH9V4nfnUULsAgBUQSm--nZRASxEc3GbF8AtvyzulpAto0ei2_WZ-DwhXlFEnZlSUEaeA45Eh56M2Py15a7tcZbLGgNnP7lSr1sKDizx3RBNbjOaS87ooXy-JEM8_FjxtWlPQL603S3YJrB=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhSRdkTVQkR5xTUFH28vGdnFalVpvcOu2KbliwaKxpGgMU27WB14jowI78TFYHHpI5DAZ2dGigvWpfRsLFMLpf4WtU8YCrgz7e61bP0qngu2Ax5ltJlKpp0QA6rmN3HUe-7ZaJAdQuSqnBPArb6fVE6dv1n0XbSrgg2JxNK1tfcYIEZTH3NO6lNgCACmMhB\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3038\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhSRdkTVQkR5xTUFH28vGdnFalVpvcOu2KbliwaKxpGgMU27WB14jowI78TFYHHpI5DAZ2dGigvWpfRsLFMLpf4WtU8YCrgz7e61bP0qngu2Ax5ltJlKpp0QA6rmN3HUe-7ZaJAdQuSqnBPArb6fVE6dv1n0XbSrgg2JxNK1tfcYIEZTH3NO6lNgCACmMhB=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我有一身拭鞋好工夫，注心tī舊koh ná beh破ê鞋仔，tī hit tsuā西照日ê tshiō光--裡親像坐禪入定！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">國校五年仔，阮阿兄阿姊kah叔伯阿兄一陣讀國中--ê，tiānn-tiānn坐tī正身ê戶tīng跤秋凊開講。我上愛聽in tī hia五四三講學校ê代誌，上特別--ê是我ē-tàng學著一寡本事。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">In讀ê國中逐禮拜一ē檢查皮鞋。Hit時tsūn，拜六讀一晡，in lóng ē tī禮拜透早kā隨人ê皮鞋提出來si-á-geh。五六个坐tī戶tīng跤，ná拭ná討論拭ê撇步，無，就講學校笑詼代，我tī邊--a看kah目睭無tńg-lûn，聽kah耳仔phak-phak。無到半冬，我mā變做一个拭鞋ê土師仔。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">有齒抿仔、鞋油、棉仔布，我就ē-tàng kā一雙舊鞋仔拭kah金sih-sih。想著平常時仔lóng是in leh照顧--我，我就kā拭鞋tsit項khang-khuè bāu--落-來。就án-ne，逐个拜六下晡，就有幾若雙kō塗沙、黏著ta--去ê lo̍k糊糜，真濟he細條、phú koh深ê jiâu痕，iah是後tenn鞋鼻已經補幾若回，koh tio̍h-ài穿kah破ê「老鞋」，囥tī大廳等--我。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">下晡時仔，坐tī大廳ê細liâu椅頭仔，我ná巡鞋仔ê空喙kah pit痕，手ná綿爛tín動，聽he si-si-su̍t-su̍t ê拭鞋聲。西照日斜--入-來ê一tsuā日鬚無聲無sueh，我心內親像翻江倒海，tī海--裡歡喜tńg-se̍h滾絞，mā親像徛tī規phiàn ê草仔埔，享受曠闊kah恬靜。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿兄阿姊講in ê鞋仔lóng有hōo訓導主任呵咾--著！M̄-koh幾冬後，逐家到外地讀冊，歇熱歇寒久久--à tsiah有一雙皮鞋thang hōo我pìnn工藝。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">有一个禮拜下晡，大廳囥一雙tsiok大跤ê兵仔鞋kah拭鞋ê家私，我臆是做兵ê叔伯阿兄--ê。想著伊190公分kuân ànn腰拭鞋，規身軀khiau--leh bē sù-sī，我就kā hit雙兵仔鞋siat-tooh--一-下，tsiah-koh走出去tshit-thô。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tńg來厝，叔伯阿兄已經tńg去兵營，桌仔頂ê鞋油硩一張50箍ê銀票。了後，逐个禮拜下晡，我lóng有拭鞋ê khang-khuè kah 50箍ê所費。Hit兩冬，tsiânn期待拭鞋hit工，m̄是hōo錢siânn--去，是hit種tàu thīn阿兄、寶惜mi̍h件ê情份。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">無人koh ē記得我有一身拭鞋ê好工夫，kan-na家己ê心內iáu有一幅恬tī ê圖。無人ē了解hit種人細漢，心內親像有溢來溢去ê海湧一港一港tshînn倚--來，hit種ē-tàng替厝內ê人付出ê熱情kah歡喜。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2129\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_